00:34:26,459 --> 00:34:48,457
[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah, and now, imagine, like, I don't think they're... unless you're extremely self-dishonest, I don't think somebody who... even the most successful person with these meta-management sort of fabrication techniques of... imagine the, as you said, like the cute cat or something in your head and extend that attitude.

343
00:34:48,477 --> 00:34:50,218
