416
00:41:48,461 --> 00:41:50,763
[SPEAKER_03]: Cognitive behavioral therapy.

417
00:41:51,063 --> 00:41:51,344
[SPEAKER_03]: No, no.

418
00:41:51,384 --> 00:41:54,986
