00:42:14,619 --> 00:42:16,000
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

429
00:42:16,221 --> 00:42:24,488
[SPEAKER_04]: So, that's because sometimes, as you said in the beginning, like there might be sort of mystical, esoteric ideas, Brahmavihāras, this and that, and then, you know, might become a bit lofty and

