431
00:42:27,789 --> 00:42:32,690
[SPEAKER_04]: But you can just ground yourself in precisely understanding one's relationship to feeling.

432
00:42:32,790 --> 00:42:35,450
[SPEAKER_04]: And just, you know, understand the virtue and the sense.

