00:42:47,673 --> 00:42:48,573
[SPEAKER_01]: The same with jhāna.

438
00:42:48,593 --> 00:42:50,934
[SPEAKER_01]: When the Buddha said, if somebody practices

439
00:42:52,714 --> 00:43:02,661
